### Get all applications

GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications


### Get application by ID

GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1


### Create application

POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Example Company",
  "role": "Graduate Software Engineer",
  "location": "Auckland",
  "status": "APPLIED",
  "dateApplied": "2026-09-27",
  "jobUrl": "https://example.com/jobs/123",
  "notes": "Applied through company website"
}


### Update application

PUT http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Example Company",
  "role": "Graduate Software Engineer",
  "location": "Auckland",
  "status": "INTERVIEW",
  "dateApplied": "2026-09-27",
  "jobUrl": "https://example.com/jobs/123",
  "notes": "Interview invitation received"
}


### Delete application

DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1